${CF}$ là cạnh chung;\\
$\widehat{CFA} = \widehat{CFG} = 90^{\circ}$ ($CF \perp AG$);\\
$FA = FG$ (cmt).\\
Suy ra $\triangle {CFA} = \triangle {CFG}$ (c.g.c).\\
Do đó $CA = CG$.
}\end{ex}

